# Frontend

- Solid.js + Vite + Tailwind. Stores in `frontend/src/stores` via `solid-js/store`.
- Wails calls: import from `../../wailsjs/go/...` (generated).
- Monaco via `@codingame/monaco-vscode-editor-api` helpers in `utils/editor`.
- Screens: `generalStore.currentScreen` (`Screen` enum). Code UI: tabs + status bar.
- To clear optional tab fields use path `setStore`, not `{ key: undefined }` merges.
- Keep status bar compact; put rare actions in popover menus.
- Result views: Structured (HTML VarDumper), Raw (plaintext Monaco), Queries.
